  "description": "<p>This task is to review and update the audit logging logic to avoid output like the following:<br/>\n```<br/>\n2017-01-08 10:59:39,544 import /import-export-testing/data/fcrepo/rest/collection0.ttl to <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/collection0/../collection0\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/collection0/../collection0</a><br/>\n```<br/>\nNote above: \"/rest/collection0/../collection0\"</p>\n\n<p>To reproduce the above output:<br/>\n1. Create a resource in your Fedora repo (collection0)<br/>\n2. Export that resource:<br/>\njava -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.0.jar -b -a -d data -m export -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/f4/rest/collection0\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/f4/rest/collection0</a><br/>\n3. Import that resource:<br/>\njava -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.0.jar -b -a -d data -m import -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/f4/rest/collection0\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/f4/rest/collection0</a><br/>\n4. Inspect log, see:<br/>\n/rest/collection0/../collection0</p>\n\n<p>See: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Sprint+3+Feedback+-+A+Woods\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Sprint+3+Feedback+-+A+Woods</a></p>",
